COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.PAYEE_NAME IS 'Payee name from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.PAYEE_BANK_CODE IS 'Payee bank code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.EVENT_REM IS 'BCO-style event reference remark, limited to 40 characters; the full HTH reference remains in SOURCE_TRX_REF_NBR.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.REF_NBR IS 'BCO numeric-format reference number from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.FROM_DTE IS 'Period start date from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.TO_DTE IS 'Period end date from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.MANDATE_ID IS 'Direct-debit mandate identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.EDDA_MAINT_ACTION IS 'Electronic direct-debit maintenance action from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.SOURCE_TRX_REF_NBR IS 'Approval transaction reference or business response reference used to correlate the event.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.PAY_CAT_PURP_CODE IS 'Payment category purpose code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.PAY_PURP_CODE IS 'Payment purpose code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DEVICE_ID IS 'Device identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.MOBILE_BRAND IS 'Operating-system label parsed from the user agent, following the BCO field convention; null when unavailable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.PLATFORM_CODE IS 'Client platform code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DEVICE_MODEL IS 'Browser brand parsed from the user agent, following the BCO field convention; null when unavailable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DEVICE_OS_VERSION IS 'Browser version parsed from the user agent, following the BCO field convention; null when unavailable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.IP_ADDRESS IS 'Client IP address supplied by the platform operation context, when available.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.FILLER_02 IS 'Secondary CRM filler from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.EVENT_AMT_HKE IS 'Event amount in Hong Kong dollar equivalent from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.EVENT_EX_RATE IS 'Event exchange rate from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.MRCH_ID IS 'Merchant identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.ACCT_CCY_CODE IS 'Account currency code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.ACCT_AMT IS 'Account-currency amount from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.SCREEN_ID IS 'BCO screen identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.OMB_FLAG IS 'One-Man-Bank approval indicator: Y for affirmative CM user/access context; null when unknown or not applicable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.MULTI_APP_REJ_TXN_CNT IS 'Count of transactions in a multiple-approval or rejection action from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.COUPON_CODE IS 'Coupon code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.ACTL_INT_RATE IS 'Actual interest rate from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.TT_AUTO_ROUTE IS 'BCO CRM automatic-routing default N for these non-financial HTH maintenance events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.SUSPICIOUS_ACTIVITY IS 'Suspicious activity classification from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.SUSPICIOUS_IND IS 'Suspicious activity indicator from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.WITH_MRCH IS 'Merchant-presence indicator from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.CMPY_NAME IS 'Merchant company name from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DOC_ID IS 'Document identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DOC_TYPE IS 'Document type from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DOC_COUNTRY_CODE IS 'Document issuing country code from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.MRCH_USER_ID IS 'Merchant user identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.MRCH_USER_NAME IS 'Merchant user name from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DOC_CMPY_NAME IS 'Company name on a document from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.DOC_ACCT_NBR IS 'Account number on a document from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.SLE_MRCH_NAME IS 'SLE merchant name from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.FORMAT IS 'Advice or document format from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.TXN_COUNT IS 'Transaction count from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.ADV_FREQ_TYPE IS 'Advice frequency type from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.ADV_TYPE IS 'Advice type from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.SLE_MRCH_ID IS 'SLE merchant identifier from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.AR_TOKEN IS 'AR token from the BCO model; reserved and always null in HTH because token values are not collected.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.TREASURY_REF IS 'Treasury reference from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_SWEEP_INSTRUCTION_TYPE IS 'Liquidity-management sweep instruction type from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_FREQUENCY_EXECUTIONDAY IS 'Liquidity-management frequency or execution day from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_EFFECTIVEDATE IS 'Liquidity-management effective date from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_RULE_SETUPDATE IS 'Liquidity-management rule setup date from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_SWEEPING_AMOUNT_THRESHOLD IS 'Liquidity-management sweep amount or threshold from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_FPXTXN_NBR IS 'Liquidity-management FPX transaction number from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.LM_INSTRUCTION_NBR IS 'Liquidity-management instruction number from the BCO model; reserved and null for current HTH CM/BM onboarding events.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.USER_ROLE IS 'Platform user role from the approved request metadata field; null when unavailable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.TOKEN_ID IS 'Authentication token identifier from the BCO model; reserved and always null in HTH because token values are not collected.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN HTH_BEA.HTH_CRM_EVENT_DETAILS.ERR_CODE IS 'BCO-model error code: first approval-processing code or TFA context code, keeping the last 20 characters; distinct from HTH ERROR_CODE.';
